Pre-release Alpha software. Benchmark rights notes and early private-reference
provenance remain engineering records rather than legal conclusions.

FFmpeg and ffprobe are external system dependencies and are not distributed
with this project.

On macOS systems whose FFmpeg lacks libass, local execution may use the
installed Swift/AppKit runtime and a system font to rasterize subtitle overlays.
No font files are distributed with this project.
